    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/de6c02a1936ad4ea0bd6522fd82797d3.avif?t=1747033481\" width=600 height=336 /></span><br>&quot;Return to the Battlefield&quot; is a next generation FPS (first person shooter) micro end game, with comparable to the picture quality of the client game, delicate operation feel and rich system gameplay. The subsequent research and development will have high requirements for art.<br>Mode introduction<br>Team competition: The game mode with the goal of destroying enemies, the first to destroy a specified number of enemies within a fixed time can win.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/dfa896f5947078734a53d101416a63f6.poster.avif?t=1747033481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/dfa896f5947078734a53d101416a63f6.webm?t=1747033481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/dfa896f5947078734a53d101416a63f6.mp4?t=1747033481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Blasting mode: The offensive side needs to use C4 bombs to destroy the target, while the defense side has to prevent the target from being destroyed, and the cooperation of the player is very high and competitive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/5c2d462be3d455b20c7ae4554007ee44.poster.avif?t=1747033481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/5c2d462be3d455b20c7ae4554007ee44.webm?t=1747033481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/5c2d462be3d455b20c7ae4554007ee44.mp4?t=1747033481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Challenge Mode: Players need to kill computer-controlled monsters and the final BOSS. In this mode, you can win the final bonus box and unique BOSS bonuses by killing monsters.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/5f9f856ee899b41191c7977bc5017605.poster.avif?t=1747033481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/5f9f856ee899b41191c7977bc5017605.webm?t=1747033481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3060700/extras/5f9f856ee899b41191c7977bc5017605.mp4?t=1747033481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
